WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:30.875
In this ninth verse,

2
00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:31.875
Lord Krishna continues

3
00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:36.125
describing the qualities necessary
for true knowledge.

4
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:41.625
Lord Krishna speaks here

5
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:44.708
of three important qualities.

6
00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:48.208
The first is detachment from sense-objects.

7
00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:49.750
This means not depending

8
00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:53.000
on external pleasures.

9
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.583
You use the senses

10
00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.791
for what is necessary,

11
00:00:56.791 --> 00:01:00.125
but you do not rely on them for joy.

12
00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:03.541
The second is the absence of ego.

13
00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:06.208
False ego arises when

14
00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:09.500
we think we are doing everything ourselves.

15
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.000
The truth is

16
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.708
that all actions happen

17
00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:14.458
under God's guidance.

18
00:01:14.458 --> 00:01:18.333
We are only instruments in His hands.

19
00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:19.458
The third is

20
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:21.916
understanding the suffering

21
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:24.750
inherent in birth, death, old age, and illness.

22
00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.208
When we reflect

23
00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:28.000
deeply on these realities,

24
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.583
we come to understand that
the body is temporary.

25
00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:33.000
This understanding gives us detachment

26
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.000
from the material world

27
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.541
and leads us toward the true goal.

28
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.083
Remember,

29
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:48.125
you have two choices

30
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:50.708
in life,

31
00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:52.750
two entirely different

32
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.541
ways of seeing.

33
00:01:56.541 --> 00:01:58.416
The first is

34
00:01:58.416 --> 00:02:00.625
the material perspective:

35
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:03.500
live for today,

36
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:07.625
chase comfort, pleasure, and prestige.

37
00:02:07.625 --> 00:02:10.000
The second is

38
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.791
the spiritual perspective:

39
00:02:13.791 --> 00:02:15.375
see this life

40
00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:19.083
as a short journey,

41
00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:24.166
and your soul as a traveller

42
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:28.000
moving toward a higher destination.

43
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.208
When you live the first way,

44
00:02:32.208 --> 00:02:35.166
sensory pleasure at any cost

45
00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:38.208
becomes the goal.

46
00:02:38.208 --> 00:02:40.333
But does it

47
00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:45.458
truly satisfy you?

48
00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:47.250
The body

49
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:51.041
grows old, breaks down,

50
00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:56.041
and ultimately leaves you.

51
00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:59.708
If this body is everything,

52
00:02:59.708 --> 00:03:02.166
then everything

53
00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:05.750
ends with death.

54
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:10.208
But this is not your final stop,

55
00:03:10.208 --> 00:03:14.541
because you are not this body.

56
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:16.708
You are the soul,

57
00:03:16.708 --> 00:03:21.166
eternal and pure.

58
00:03:21.166 --> 00:03:24.583
When you contemplate birth, death,

59
00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:28.250
illness, and old age

60
00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.166
not with fear

61
00:03:29.166 --> 00:03:33.875
but with clarity,

62
00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:36.583
you begin to understand

63
00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:40.333
what truly matters.

64
00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:43.291
The Gita invites you

65
00:03:43.291 --> 00:03:44.375
to shift your

66
00:03:44.375 --> 00:03:48.708
perspective,

67
00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:51.958
to stop chasing pleasure

68
00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:57.000
and focus on the pursuit of truth.

69
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.208
This shift in perspective

70
00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:02.541
changes everything.

71
00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:09.250
In our homes,

72
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.583
we celebrate birth

73
00:04:12.583 --> 00:04:15.000
and grieve death

74
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:19.250
with a heavy heart.

75
00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:24.125
But have you ever paused and thought,

76
00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:27.458
what is the experience of birth

77
00:04:27.458 --> 00:04:32.500
or death for the soul?

78
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.416
From the soul's perspective,

79
00:04:35.416 --> 00:04:37.541
both involve suffering,

80
00:04:37.541 --> 00:04:41.666
because birth is not a beginning.

81
00:04:41.666 --> 00:04:45.541
It is a continuation of a cycle

82
00:04:45.541 --> 00:04:48.791
that includes pain, confusion,

83
00:04:48.791 --> 00:04:53.250
and forgetting one's true identity.

84
00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.250
And death,

85
00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:56.166
though

86
00:04:56.166 --> 00:05:00.041
inevitable, brings fear,

87
00:05:00.041 --> 00:05:03.500
because deep within,

88
00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.000
all of us know

89
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:09.458
that we should not end.

90
00:05:09.458 --> 00:05:13.291
Even those who are not spiritual

91
00:05:13.291 --> 00:05:17.791
do not enjoy growing old, falling ill,

92
00:05:17.791 --> 00:05:21.375
or facing

93
00:05:21.375 --> 00:05:24.500
death.

94
00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.625
These are not signs of weakness,

95
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:32.666
they are signs that within us

96
00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:35.583
there is something that longs for more,

97
00:05:35.583 --> 00:05:38.875
something beyond this world.

98
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:41.583
So do not treat death

99
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:44.666
as a forbidden subject at home.

100
00:05:44.666 --> 00:05:49.000
Let it become a quiet teacher.

101
00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:54.000
Have honest conversations with your family.

102
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.416
Use these realities

103
00:05:56.416 --> 00:05:59.750
to awaken questions, go deeper,

104
00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:02.958
and prepare,

105
00:06:02.958 --> 00:06:07.000
not with fear, but with wisdom.

106
00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.291
Accepting the certainty of death

107
00:06:10.291 --> 00:06:12.583
brings peace

108
00:06:12.583 --> 00:06:14.125
and stability to life.

109
00:06:18.791 --> 00:06:20.166
Tell Me,

110
00:06:20.166 --> 00:06:25.000
what kind of leadership moves you?

111
00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.083
In today's world, people

112
00:06:27.083 --> 00:06:30.083
follow leaders not only

113
00:06:30.083 --> 00:06:33.083
for their intelligence

114
00:06:33.083 --> 00:06:37.000
but also for their steadiness.

115
00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.625
And the two things that slowly destroy

116
00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:45.541
a leader's credibility

117
00:06:45.541 --> 00:06:49.208
are ego and uncontrolled

118
00:06:49.208 --> 00:06:52.333
indulgence.

119
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:53.750
History

120
00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:56.208
shows this repeatedly,

121
00:06:56.208 --> 00:06:59.916
when leaders become arrogant

122
00:06:59.916 --> 00:07:04.333
or yield to temptation,

123
00:07:04.333 --> 00:07:07.458
trust collapses.

124
00:07:07.458 --> 00:07:09.208
True leadership

125
00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:11.916
begins with humility.

126
00:07:11.916 --> 00:07:16.041
When you are free from false ego,

127
00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:19.083
you stop thinking

128
00:07:19.083 --> 00:07:22.333
'I am the doer'

129
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:25.916
and begin thinking

130
00:07:25.916 --> 00:07:28.666
'I am here to serve,

131
00:07:28.666 --> 00:07:31.541
to guide.'

132
00:07:31.541 --> 00:07:33.958
This shift brings calm,

133
00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:37.250
clarity, and respect.

134
00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.208
When you are

135
00:07:38.208 --> 00:07:42.041
not chasing pleasure at every turn,

136
00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:43.083
people

137
00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:44.791
see you as a stable

138
00:07:44.791 --> 00:07:47.166
person,

139
00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:50.333
one they can trust.

140
00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:54.291
You are not easily swayed.

141
00:07:54.291 --> 00:07:57.291
You lead by

142
00:07:57.291 --> 00:07:59.166
example.

143
00:07:59.166 --> 00:08:03.333
If you wish to be respected not only

144
00:08:03.333 --> 00:08:04.416
for your skill

145
00:08:04.416 --> 00:08:05.791
but for your strength

146
00:08:05.791 --> 00:08:09.166
of character,

147
00:08:09.166 --> 00:08:12.250
work on both of these.

148
00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.250
The more you master your ego

149
00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.583
and your

150
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:20.041
senses,

151
00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:22.125
the more unshakeable

152
00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:26.208
and inspiring your leadership becomes.
